@startuml Axiom_Sequence_Diagram
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title Canvas Sync & 20-Minute Cache Invalidation Flow

actor Student as User
participant "Next.js Frontend\n(/site/dashboard)" as Web
participant "Express REST API\n(POST /api/dashboard)" as API
participant "RouteService\n(ensureUser & Cache)" as RS
participant "DatabaseService\n(Prisma Layer)" as DB
database "PostgreSQL\n(axiom)" as PG
participant "Crypto Service\n(AES-GCM / HMAC)" as Crypto
participant "CanvasClient\n(or MockClient)" as Canvas

User -> Web: Open Dashboard
Web -> API: POST /api/dashboard { apiKey }
API -> RS: userRequestedDashboard(apiKey)

== 1. Cache Check & User Lookup ==
RS -> DB: getUserIDByApiKey(apiKey)
DB -> PG: SELECT encrypted_user_id, encrypted_api_key FROM user_api_keys
PG --> DB: Rows
DB -> Crypto: decryptValue(encrypted_api_key)
Crypto --> DB: Raw API key
DB --> RS: Matching userID

RS -> DB: lastUpdated(userID)
DB -> PG: SELECT updated_at FROM updates ORDER BY updated_at DESC LIMIT 1
PG --> DB: lastUpdate timestamp
DB --> RS: lastUpdate

alt Data is Fresh (< 20 minutes old)
    RS -> DB: getUserCourses(userID)
    DB -> PG: SELECT * FROM user_courses JOIN course
    PG --> DB: Cached courses
    DB --> RS: Courses
    RS -> DB: getUserGradeInformation(userID)
    DB --> RS: Grades
    RS --> API: Aggregated Dashboard Data (From Cache)
else Data is Stale or First-Time (> 20 minutes old)
    == 2. Live Canvas Fetch & Normalization ==
    RS -> Canvas: GetUserInformation()
    Canvas --> RS: Raw Profile JSON
    RS -> Canvas: GetCourses()
    Canvas --> RS: Raw Courses JSON
    
    RS -> RS: mapper.cleanUserInformation(me)
    RS -> RS: mapper.cleanCourses(courses)

    == 3. Encrypted Database Persistence via Prisma ==
    RS -> DB: pushGeneralUserInfo(userInfo, apiKey)
    DB -> Crypto: hmacLookup(userID) -> deterministic hash
    DB -> Crypto: encryptValue(firstName), encryptValue(apiKey)
    DB -> PG: prisma.user.upsert & prisma.userApiKey.upsert & prisma.userInfo.upsert
    
    RS -> DB: pushCourseInformation(cleanCourses)
    DB -> PG: prisma.course.upsert
    
    RS -> DB: pushUserCourses(userID, courseIDs)
    DB -> PG: prisma.userCourse.upsert
    
    RS -> DB: syncUpdate(userID)
    DB -> PG: prisma.update.create (current timestamp)
    
    RS --> API: Fresh Aggregated Dashboard Data
end

API --> Web: HTTP 200 { userInfo, courses, assignments, grades }
Web --> User: Render Dashboard Cards & Metrics

@enduml
